{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50679","headline":"江南杂题三十首 其八 · 张祜","name":"江南杂题三十首 其八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"村桥路不端，数里就回湍。\n积壤连泾脉，高林上笋竿。\n早尝甘蔗淡，生摘琵琶酸。\n（「琵琶」，严寿澄校《张祜诗集》云：疑「枇杷」之误。\n）好是去尘俗，烟花长一栏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}